WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.829 --> 00:00:02.749
- All right, let's finish
up this hour with something

00:00:02.749 --> 00:00:04.590
super uplifting from social media.

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:05.790
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:08.520
(audience cheers)

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.780
For many women,

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.340
getting pregnant isn't easy.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.920
So a fertility doctor
here in Irvine, California

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.753
wants to be sure

00:00:14.753 --> 00:00:17.550
when his patients find
out they are expecting,

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.900
that they feel all the joy

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:19.740
that they deserve.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.990
So this is how he shares the news

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:23.523
with every single patient.

00:00:26.478 --> 00:00:28.736
[Group] You're pregnant!

00:00:28.736 --> 00:00:30.969
(cheers)

00:00:30.969 --> 00:00:32.969
(claps)

00:00:34.011 --> 00:00:34.857
- Not only are you pregnant,

00:00:34.857 --> 00:00:38.150
but you are massively pregnant.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.691
(cheers)

00:00:39.691 --> 00:00:40.910
- You get a baby,

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:41.743
you get a baby.

00:00:41.743 --> 00:00:42.600
It's amazing. I love that.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.670
We have this very enthusiastic doctor

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.470
and his staff on the line, right now.

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:48.540
Watching on NBC 4 Los Angeles,

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:50.659
everybody say hi to Dr
Larry and his staff.

00:00:50.659 --> 00:00:52.000
(cheers)

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:52.833
What's up y'all?

00:00:54.019 --> 00:00:54.900
[All] Hello!

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:55.800
- Oh, my gosh.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.050
So Doctor Larry, you've
been telling couples that

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:00.670
they're expecting this
way for 40 years, right?

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:01.980
- Absolutely.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:04.390
I can't remember a time when we haven't

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:06.900
told our patients this.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:11.220
You know Kelly, it's an
incredible rollercoaster

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:13.140
that these patients are on.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.940
From a physical standpoint,

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.890
an emotional standpoint.

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:18.990
It's absolutely unbelievable.

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:21.690
So when they finally reach that point

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:23.760
where things are positive,

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:26.580
we wanna be just as big
a part of their lives

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:27.810
as we can.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:31.890
And that's why we do it all together.

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:32.880
- I know, I love that!

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:33.810
The whole staff.

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:36.000
That's so cool y'all.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.180
It's a very special moment for
every woman to find that out.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:40.740
You know, every father
too, to find that out.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.630
So it's very cool that y'all do that.

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:43.800
- Well, thank you Kelly.

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.120
- Absolutely.

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:46.530
I love that you've been
doing it for 40 years.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:49.630
I'm like um, a lot of them
haven't been here for that long.

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:51.240
(laughs) That's amazing.

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:52.740
I was like, wait.

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:55.120
Thank you so much, Doctor Larry.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:56.400
(applause)

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.050
I'm liking your post right now.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.235
We love y'all.

00:01:59.235 --> 00:02:00.068
(ding)

00:02:00.068 --> 00:02:00.901
And that's not all.

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:02.250
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:03.990
makers of Frixion, the go-to erasable pen

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.430
of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:06.810
want to celebrate doctors

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:09.090
like you, who give your patients your all.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:11.538
So they're gonna give you
$1,000, just for being rad.

00:02:11.538 --> 00:02:12.739
(claps)

00:02:12.739 --> 00:02:15.078
(cheers)

00:02:15.078 --> 00:02:15.911
- Thank you!

00:02:15.911 --> 00:02:16.920
- [Kelly] Thank y'all so much!

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.840
Have a wonderful day!

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.910
And thank you to all our guests today.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.790
Joe Manganiello, Casey
Wilson, Danielle Schneider,

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:25.620
Stephanie Izard, Shawn and Sara,

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:26.453
ya'll have a great day.

00:02:26.453 --> 00:02:28.153
And if it's not, try and change it.

